WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.180
NARRATOR: Tomás is twenty-eight.

2
00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:20.520
He has walked into a community mental
health clinic without an appointment.

3
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.280
For three weeks, he has had intrusive
thoughts and has barely slept.

4
00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:27.020
TOMÁS: Sorry, I don't have an appointment.

5
00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:28.630
I just... I'm not sleeping.

6
00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:31.060
Two, three hours maybe.

7
00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:34.900
Before I say anything, I have to ask.

8
00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:36.360
Does this go to immigration?

9
00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:37.880
Anything I say here?

10
00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.520
<i>Es que no quiero problemas.
Tengo familia aquí.</i>

11
00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:43.380
My brother, his kids.

12
00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:47.700
(sighs) The thoughts don't stop.
At work, at night.

13
00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:51.440
I keep seeing it, over and over,
and I can't turn it off.

14
00:00:51.620 --> 00:00:54.620
Sometimes I think it would be
easier to just not wake up.

15
00:00:55.740 --> 00:00:57.380
I don't want a big evaluation.

16
00:00:57.660 --> 00:00:59.100
<i>No quiero papeles.</i>

17
00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:01.140
<i>No quiero estar en ningún sistema.</i>

18
00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:02.680
So tell me the truth.

19
00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:04.800
If I talk to you, who else finds out?

20
00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:08.140
NARRATOR: Tomás has asked
who else will find out.

21
00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:09.900
How do you respond?
